From 64c79eaad6f68ba1f310f5157cf07472093d5887 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: optimizer <optimizer@hydrogen>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:38:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] E016: test the streaming verifier against verbatim copies of
 the 31c26d9 verifiers

Adds ArithmeticCircuitStatement::verify_base (feature tests) and Fcmp::verify_base (cfg(test)), the pre-streaming verifiers copied by line range from 31c26d9 with only the names changed, and three tests comparing the streaming path against them on 8 honest shapes, every tampering region and 256 random single-byte mutations: identical batch-verifier state (additional as a multiset), identical errors, batch never verifies when tampered. The tampering-region computation of the existing test moves into a shared helper. Closes F1 of the E007 crypto review.
